{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Science used to be your purpose, but now it is your prison.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play a scientist trapped in a distorted version of your own lab, an alternate reality shaped by the quiet, often unseen struggles of scientific research. Through light 2D combat, use lab-inspired tools and companions to battle your way out. As in science, the way forward isn't always a choice.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short narrative journey with an emotional, introspective tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2D combat using lab equipment and science-themed companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rooted in the lived experience of someone who's been through the ups and downs of research</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824280/extras/PIcture.png?t=1752625192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Alright. Deep breaths. Let\u2019s find the way out of here. I\u2019ve got loads of experiments waiting for me back in the real world.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Researcher's log</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I started this game while unemployed, after moving to a new country, and decided to finish it after settling into a new job in a lab. It\u2019s inspired by the quieter, often unspoken stories behind scientific research. I hope the game resonates with you, even just a little bit, whether you're in the lab, playing for the story, or just finding your way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Shaun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824280?t=1752625192","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824280?t=1752625192","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824280/937735b51b7564df804acdbec80ca17eb61688c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752625192","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824280/937735b51b7564df804acdbec80ca17eb61688c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752625192","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Science used to be your purpose, but now it is your prison.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play a scientist trapped in a distorted version of your own lab, an alternate reality shaped by the quiet, often unseen struggles of scientific research. Through light 2D combat, use lab-inspired tools and companions to battle your way out. As in science, the way forward isn't always a choice.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short narrative journey with an emotional, introspective tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2D combat using lab equipment and science-themed companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rooted in the lived experience of someone who's been through the ups and downs of research</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824280/extras/PIcture.png?t=1752625192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Alright. Deep breaths. Let\u2019s find the way out of here. I\u2019ve got loads of experiments waiting for me back in the real world.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Researcher's log</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I started this game while unemployed, after moving to a new country, and decided to finish it after settling into a new job in a lab. It\u2019s inspired by the quieter, often unspoken stories behind scientific research. I hope the game resonates with you, even just a little bit, whether you're in the lab, playing for the story, or just finding your way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Shaun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Shaun'sLabNotes"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824280/405f97cdd321013ef0433c04e0699ca664159d7b/header.jpg?t=1752625192","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257169349,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169349/movie480.mp4?t=1752625186","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169349/movie_max.mp4?t=1752625186"},"name":"Launch teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257169349/7d282c17bc7f9d2cc9eb931ab1b57d77f64a6b73/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752625186","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169349/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752625186","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169349/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752625186"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257166670,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166670/movie480.mp4?t=1752625190","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166670/movie_max.mp4?t=1752625190"},"name":"Gameplay / Cinematic trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257166670/7b9f96b0cd1b58193cf252f6a95cbdacd91dc7d1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752625190","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166670/movie480_vp9.w